 "description": "OpenAI GPT-5.6: the entry lifetime is a 30-minute minimum, and the owner decision is that 30 minutes is 30 minutes (R45). Turn 1 caches 17,000 tokens. A ping at minute 30 reads them and renews the entry. The next request arrives at minute 35, 35 minutes after turn 1 and so past the lifetime, but 5 minutes after the ping and so inside it. The rescue is credited: 17,000 x ($3.75 - $0.30) = +$0.05865. The ping costs 17,000 x $0.30 + 10 x $3.00 + $15.00 per million = -$0.00513. Total +$0.05352.",
